# Manual requests (VS Code / Codespaces "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request").
# Start the stack first:  docker compose --profile app up -d --build --scale app=3
# Instances answer on 3000, 3001 and 3002.

@base = http://localhost:3000
@other = http://localhost:3001
@player = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1

### 1. Health
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### 2. Create a wallet with 100.00 (copy the "id" from the response into @wallet below)
POST {{base}}/wallets
content-type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{player}}", "initialBalance": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

###
@wallet = paste-the-wallet-id-here

### 3. BET 80.00 -> 200 PROCESSED, balance 20.00
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
content-type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:manual-bet-1

{ "providerId": "provider-a", "externalTransactionId": "manual-bet-1", "playerId": "{{player}}", "walletId": "{{wallet}}", "roundId": "round-1", "gameId": "fortune-chimp", "kind": "BET", "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

### 4. Same request on another instance -> same answer, idempotentReplay: true
POST {{other}}/wagering/transactions
content-type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:manual-bet-1

{ "providerId": "provider-a", "externalTransactionId": "manual-bet-1", "playerId": "{{player}}", "walletId": "{{wallet}}", "roundId": "round-1", "gameId": "fortune-chimp", "kind": "BET", "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

### 5. Same key, different amount -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
content-type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:manual-bet-1

{ "providerId": "provider-a", "externalTransactionId": "manual-bet-1", "playerId": "{{player}}", "walletId": "{{wallet}}", "roundId": "round-1", "gameId": "fortune-chimp", "kind": "BET", "money": { "amount": "81.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

### 6. Another BET 80.00 -> 422 REJECTED, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
content-type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:manual-bet-2

{ "providerId": "provider-a", "externalTransactionId": "manual-bet-2", "playerId": "{{player}}", "walletId": "{{wallet}}", "roundId": "round-1", "gameId": "fortune-chimp", "kind": "BET", "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

### 7. REFUND of the first BET -> 200, balance back to 100.00
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
content-type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:manual-refund-1

{ "providerId": "provider-a", "externalTransactionId": "manual-refund-1", "playerId": "{{player}}", "walletId": "{{wallet}}", "roundId": "round-1", "gameId": "fortune-chimp", "kind": "REFUND", "referenceExternalTransactionId": "manual-bet-1", "money": { "amount": "80.00", "currency": "BRL" } }

### 8. Ledger
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{wallet}}/ledger?limit=50

### 9. Reconciliation -> consistent: true
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{wallet}}/reconciliation

### 10. Metrics
GET {{base}}/metrics
